   "body": "**Delta review of 82447c38..2f441abb (cloud/orch, Opus 5.5; the author is Sonnet): APPROVE.** Findings: none.\n\n- The change is docs only: `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md` and `docs/lots/LOT-056-image-hosts.md`. The code is unchanged since the reviewed head.\n- The new citation is correct. `Classes/RehostImage.m:328-343` @ `87fe0d1c` holds the example Chevereto answer `\"medium\": {\"filename\": \"example.md.png\", …, \"url\": \"…/example.md.png\"}`, and `:366-368` reads `image.medium.url` into `link_medium`, both checked with `git show 87fe0d1c:Classes/RehostImage.m`.\n- The legacy-store sample is now labelled synthetic, the shape stays **code** (not verified), and capture #922 is referenced.\n- The PR body`s Ledger row has the `87fe0d1c` range.\n\nThe App job is green on the re-run, so merging.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
